<title>UK: KfW unit sets 10 billion peseta 20-year bond.</title>
<headline>KfW unit sets 10 billion peseta 20-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by</p>
<p>lead manager Banco Central Hispano.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KFW INTERNATIONAL FINANCE</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  KREDITANSTALT FUER WIEDERAUFBAU</p>
<p> AMT     10 BLN ESP   COUPON     6.75	MATURITY    13.JAN.17</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.65     PAY DATE    13.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	LISTING    AIAF	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (M) 1</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.00	SELL CONC  1.00</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
